@page "/markets/power-management"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Power Management: Power Modules & Discretes";
    ViewData["Motion"] = "market";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Hana assembles IGBT and SiC power modules, IPMs and power discretes for EV, solar, wind and industrial drive equipment, with reliability and cycling test.";
    ViewData["Canonical"] = "https://www.hanagroup.com/markets/power-management";
}
@section Head {
    <style>.mk-card--static{cursor:default}.mk-card--static:hover{transform:none !important;box-shadow:none !important;border-color:var(--line) !important}.mk-card--static .body{background:var(--bg)}</style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/market-page.css" />
}

<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Power Management</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><span class="hero-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 class="mk-h1">Power management: modules and discretes</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures IGBT and SiC power modules, intelligent power modules and power discretes for inverters, motor drives, chargers and other power-electronics applications. The modules are integrated by customers into their own finished equipment.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="/images/photos/mk-power-management-hero.webp" alt="IGBT and SiC power module assembly inside an inverter housing" style="object-position:30% center;" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><a href="/capabilities/osat/power-packages#power-modules">IGBT power modules</a><a href="/capabilities/osat/power-packages#power-modules">SiC power modules</a><a href="/markets/automotive/power-modules">EV traction inverter modules</a><a href="/markets/automotive/power-modules">On-board charger modules</a><span>IPM motor-control modules</span><span>Solar inverter modules</span><span>Wind converter modules</span><a href="/capabilities/osat/power-packages#power-discretes">Power discretes</a><a href="/capabilities/osat/power-packages#top-side-cooling">Top-side cooling packages</a><a href="/capabilities/osat/power-packages#gan">GaN packages</a><span>Dual Cool (Compact)</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark" data-hana-geo="side" data-geo-theme="blue"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Power packaging built around the thermal path</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Power-module reliability depends on the construction of the thermal and current paths through the package. Reliability and cycling test are available to verify that construction according to program requirements.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Silicon and wide-bandgap</div><p>Assembly capability for silicon, SiC and GaN devices, including laser dicing processes for wide-bandgap materials.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Built for the thermal path</div><p>DBC substrates, heavy copper interconnect, high-thermal die attach and silver-sinter processes for power-module thermal and current-path requirements.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Power-module and discrete manufacturing across Hana sites in Thailand and China provides additional capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c3"><a class="mk-card" href="/capabilities/osat/power-packages"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/cap-osat-power-packages-hero.webp" alt="Power discrete and module packages"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Power Packages &amp; Modules</div><p>Power discretes, top-side cooling packages, power modules and GaN packages, with package sizes, maximum die sizes and AEC-Q101 qualification.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/automotive/power-modules"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-auto-card-power-modules.webp" alt="Power modules on an electrified powertrain"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Automotive Power Modules</div><p>IGBT and SiC power modules for traction inverters, on-board chargers and DC-DC converters.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><div class="mk-card mk-card--static" id="industrial"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-power-industrial-energy.webp" alt="Electric vehicle charging and wind turbines" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Industrial &amp; Energy Modules</div><p>IGBT and SiC modules and IPMs specified into photovoltaic and wind converters, industrial inverters and motor drives, AC-DC and power-factor-correction stages, rail traction and EV charging infrastructure.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2><p class="mk-body">Power-module and discrete assembly runs within Hana&rsquo;s OSAT operations in Thailand and China. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from power-electronics engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What power products does Hana build?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures power semiconductor modules and discretes, including IGBT and SiC modules, IPMs for motor control, and power discretes in through-hole and surface-mount package formats.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana make finished inverters or EV chargers?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana's manufacturing scope is at power-module and discrete-device level. These packaged semiconductor products are integrated by customers into finished inverters, converters, motor drives and chargers.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana assemble SiC and GaN as well as silicon?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Silicon, SiC and GaN devices can all be assembled. Wafer processing for wide-bandgap materials is described on <a href="/capabilities/osat/wafer-processing">Wafer Processing</a>.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which industrial applications do Hana power modules serve?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Photovoltaic and wind converters, industrial inverters and motor drives, AC-DC and power-factor-correction stages, rail traction equipment and EV charging infrastructure. Hana assembles the module that goes into this equipment, not the finished equipment.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can a power-module program be dual-sourced?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Power-module processes are qualified in Thailand and China, so a program can be dual-sourced from multiple countries within the same company.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start a power module build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the module switches and where it runs. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>

